# web/dist is the embed target: the placeholder page must be tracked (without it
# //go:embed all:dist does not compile), while a real build's output must not be
# — the release stamps that in and it is nobody's source. The blanket `dist/`
# rule above would take the directory whole, so it is re-opened here.
!/web/dist/
/web/dist/*
!/web/dist/index.html
